  <view class="pg10-card charter-hero"><view class="charter-mark">♡<view>✓</view></view><view class="charter-kicker">● IRL CHARTER · 纯粹相遇</view><view class="charter-title">在真实世界，纯粹相遇</view><view class="charter-subtitle">Project IRL 希望与参与者一起营造真诚、守时、友善且充满包容的线下社群环境。</view><view class="charter-values"><view>守时<text>尊重时间</text></view><view>友善<text>尊重边界</text></view><view>透明<text>费用清晰</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card guideline-card"><view class="guideline-head"><view class="pg10-icon">◷</view><view><view>守时与契约精神</view><text>Punctuality & Reliability</text></view><text class="head-tag pink">核心底线</text></view><view class="guideline-body"><view><text>▣</text><view><view class="rule-title">拒绝无故爽约</view>主办方与参与者应核对活动时间和规则；如不能参加，请依活动规则及时取消。</view></view><view><text>⌁</text><view><view class="rule-title">重要变更再确认</view>场地、时间等重大变更应按当前流程重新告知和确认。</view></view></view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card guideline-card"><view class="guideline-head"><view class="pg10-icon violet">♧</view><view><view>友善、包容与边界感</view><text>Inclusivity & Boundaries</text></view><text class="head-tag violet-tag">社交边界</text></view><view class="guideline-body"><view><text>♧</text><view><view class="rule-title">尊重多元差异</view>经验、水平和背景不同的人，仍应得到平等尊重。</view></view><view><text>⊘</text><view><view class="rule-title">零容忍骚扰与强推</view>未经同意不得索取或传播联系方式、照片与私密信息。</view></view></view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card guideline-card"><view class="guideline-head"><view class="pg10-icon green">▤</view><view><view>透明、合理的费用 AA</view><text>Fair & Clear Accounting</text></view><text class="head-tag green-tag">财务守信</text></view><view class="guideline-body"><view><text>◎</text><view><view class="rule-title">费用明细公开</view>报名时明确费用模式和每人上限；额外费用应在活动内说明。</view></view><view><text>ϟ</text><view><view class="rule-title">双方标记仅作记录</view>费用页的标记不是平台收付款或交易凭证。</view></view></view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card guideline-card"><view class="guideline-head"><view class="pg10-icon lime">▧</view><view><view>肖像权与记录边界</view><text>Respect for Privacy & Photos</text></view></view><view class="guideline-body"><view><text>✓</text><view>拍摄和传播他人影像前应取得本人同意；活动相册尚未开放。</view></view><view><text>♢</text><view>平台提供举报、屏蔽及本人数据请求入口，保护个人边界。</view></view></view></view>
  <view class="pg10-card guideline-quote"><view>“把有趣的人聚在真实世界，用真实守护彼此的善意。”</view><text>— Project IRL 当前社区引导</text><button bindtap="goReport">需要帮助？前往举报与求助　›</button></view>
